# What the image build never needs, and what must never be in it. Anything not listed here and not
# named by a COPY in the Dockerfile does not reach the image either: the final stage copies only
# the bundle, its two run-time packages, the web app and the playbooks.

# Version control and CI
.git
.github

# Installed and built files: the build makes its own
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and local settings
.env
.env.*

# Contracts and results: uploads, the embedded database, and what a review writes
data
**/data
*.redlined.docx
*.report.json
*.summary.md
evals/results

# Tests, fixtures, evaluations and their output
**/test
fixtures
e2e
evals/src
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
out

# Documentation and tooling
docs
tools
